WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.426
A game is a few rules, some data, and a loop.

2
00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:08.629
Press Start, and the loop begins. A timer makes the turtle hop.

3
00:00:12.182 --> 00:00:16.457
The data is the score, the turtle's spot, and whether it is showing.

4
00:00:17.458 --> 00:00:21.808
The rules say what each click means. Each one checks showing first.

5
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:27.208
The path is two lists of numbers, so good players predict the next spot.
